# Public Mapbox access token (required for the map).
# Create or edit a token at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# Use a public token (pk.*) — it is embedded in the client bundle.
# Under URL restrictions, allow every origin you serve from, e.g.:
#   - http://localhost:5173  (pnpm dev)
#   - https://your-production-host.example  (deploy / preview)
# Docs: https://docs.mapbox.com/accounts/guides/tokens/#url-restrictions
VITE_MAPBOX_GL_JS_PUBLIC=
